close_reason: Preserve the completed 2026-05-26 release-hardening record without treating it as current publication approval; the superseding full-history privacy gate remains active in pm-csv-uaq1 and GitHub issue 72.
body: "The 2026-05-26 package hardening established pm tracking, changelog generation, CI/release automation, and then-current source/package checks. Current-tree package and acceptance gates still pass. A broader 2026-08-20 all-ref audit superseded the earlier reachable-history privacy conclusion by finding historical personal identity and absolute host-path artifacts; future publication remains blocked by pm-csv-uaq1 and GitHub issue 72 pending explicitly authorized coordinated history repair."
